    {
      "fileKey": "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic",
      "inputHash": "sha256:a7e73dbeaa984cff64761517e365f02f96030dd1826219be446923ef56889196",
      "status": "proposed",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-14T04:45:38.874Z",
      "modelId": "deepseek-v4-pro",
      "units": [
        {
          "unitId": "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic-u1",
          "name": "Result优先策略",
          "objectIds": [
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H2-1-HEURISTIC-01",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H2-1-ANTIPATTERN-02",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-3-HEURISTIC-01"
          ],
          "anchors": [
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic#h2-1",
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic#h3-3"
          ],
          "rationale": "这些对象共同回答‘定义可能失败的函数时，默认应返回 Result 还是直接 panic!’这一核心问题：默认返回 Result，避免对可恢复错误滥用 panic!，并让调用者决定如何处理预期失败。"
        },
        {
          "unitId": "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic-u2",
          "name": "unwrap/expect使用边界",
          "objectIds": [
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-1-HEURISTIC-01",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-1-HEURISTIC-02",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-2-ENGINEERINGRULE-01",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-2-ENGINEERINGRULE-02"
          ],
          "anchors": [
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic#h3-1",
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic#h3-2"
          ],
          "rationale": "这些对象都围绕‘什么情况下可以使用 unwrap/expect，什么情况下不能’这一边界：测试、示例和原型中可接受；人工检查保证不会 Err 时可接受；但当值来自用户、存在失败可能时必须改用更健壮的 Result 处理。"
        },
        {
          "unitId": "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic-u3",
          "name": "验证与新类型",
          "objectIds": [
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-3-ENGINEERINGRULE-02",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-4-ENGINEERINGRULE-01"
          ],
          "anchors": [
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic#h3-3",
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic#h3-4"
          ],
          "rationale": "这两个对象都回答‘如何保证代码操作的值始终有效’这一同类问题：要么在操作前验证、无效时 panic!；要么通过新类型在构造时封装验证，使无效状态无法传播。"
        }
      ],
      "skills": [
        {
          "skillId": "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic-s1",
          "name": "Rust错误处理决策",
          "trigger": "当编写或审查 Rust 代码，需要判断可能失败的操作应该返回 Result、何时允许 unwrap/expect、何时用 panic!，以及如何通过类型封装来避免无效状态时，应阅读本候选。",
          "unitIds": [
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic-u1",
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic-u2",
            "ch09-03-to-panic-or-not-to-panic-u3"
          ],
          "objectIds": [
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H2-1-HEURISTIC-01",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H2-1-ANTIPATTERN-02",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-3-HEURISTIC-01",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-1-HEURISTIC-01",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-1-HEURISTIC-02",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-2-ENGINEERINGRULE-01",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-2-ENGINEERINGRULE-02",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-3-ENGINEERINGRULE-02",
            "CH09-03-TO-PANIC-OR-NOT-TO-PANIC-H3-4-ENGINEERINGRULE-01"
          ],
          "rationale": "这三个单元面向同一批使用场景：开发者面对可能失败或可能产生无效值的代码时，需要依据可恢复性、调用上下文和值来源，在 Result、unwrap/expect、panic! 及新类型验证之间做出选择，因此共同构成一个完整的错误处理决策框架。"
        }
      ],
