            "ch17-03-oo-design-patterns#h3-5"
          ],
          "rationale": "Box<Self> 接收者、Option::take 和 as_ref 都是 Rust 状态转移中处理 Box<State> 所有权的机制，回答如何安全地移出或借用旧状态。"
        },
        {
          "unitId": "ch17-03-oo-design-patterns-u4",
          "name": "状态对象职责与局限",
          "objectIds": [
            "CH17-03-OO-DESIGN-PATTERNS-H3-5-ENGINEERINGRULE-02",
            "CH17-03-OO-DESIGN-PATTERNS-H3-6-ENGINEERINGRULE-01",
